: {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "27125292497071147", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28611852641748451"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1252765963588051"}]}, "change_log": " New\n  \u2022 Wrap-around mode \u2014 curve ultra-wide 2D video into a cylinder that wraps around you at a constant distance for maximum immersion.\n  \u2022 Render-quality profiles \u2014 boost sharpness at the cost of performance (slider in the player + in Settings).\n  \u2022 Refresh-rate selector and A/B-button mapping added to the player menu, with on-screen next/previous prompts.\n\n  Improvements\n  \u2022 Smoother SMB/network streaming and faster seeking; sidecar .srt subtitle support.\n  \u2022 Cleaner player menu \u2014 simplified, easier-to-hit controls, live refresh-rate readout, clearer Back/Exit.\n  \u2022 Smaller, optimized build.\n\n  Fixes\n  \u2022 Returning to the library (Back/Exit) no longer drops to a black screen or the home environment.\n  \u2022 Multi-video playback now starts even on devices with very large libraries.", "created_date": 1782253014, "id": "28528942033372846", "version": "3.2", "version_code": 31, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}